Flat on top, with bottom that fits into the cutout in the bottom of a phone holder.

Has a smaller hole than earlier designs so that narrower phones don't
fall through it.

Top is flat because it is meant to be printed upside-down.
This means there's no ridge around the edge to hold phones
centered in place, but since phones are all different sizes,
this might just be a feature.


