Mostly exists to compare filament usage.

According to Slic3r, this uses almost twice as much filament (125.19 cc)
as p1733 (which uses 63.19 cc).

p1736, p1735, and p1737 use progressively more than p1733,
but still over 1/3 less than this solid version.

