Cut into the bottom of a convenient 3/4-inch cube.

Findings (from 2025-03-02T20:36-KM):
- The barrel connector fits loosely into the hole.  If you want it tight, add glue.
- Counterbore could be a tiny bit deeper to account for sagging when printed upside-down,
  but is basically fine.
- When printed right-side up the connector sits just barely below the surface.

