Finding: Works better than p1884, but (at least with the small pencil I tried with)
too much wiggle room to make a precise center line.

Could benefit from a pencil lead-sized hole in the bottom rather
than the full pencil width all the way through.

It works better with a different pencil that's more snug in the hole.

