Findings: (tl;dr: go with p2005, instead)
- Snaps *very* securely to Minirail
- The vertically-printed one feels like it snaps on a little more 'cleanly'
- Very hard to pry back off of the rail
- Might want to just reduce the overhang a bit to make it snap on/off more easily
- Theoretically a clip could be designed that clips onto minirail or into the Clarp2505 female shape

