Findings (2025-10-27T12:44-KM):
- [X] Fits through 1+1/4"-7-UNC nut
- [X] Can be slid together (after trimming with nippers and a bit of fiddling)
- [X] Holds a GX12 port

The sliding-together mechanism is questionable; it may work better to
'snap' them together using a pliers or something, but once assembled
it feels neat and sturdy enough.

Could be thicker, given how long the stems on these GX12 ports are.

