7mm slots and 7/16" 'counterbore', for holding hex bolt heads.
More compact than weld nuts, see.
And wide enough to let dovetail nuts heads stick up in a bit.

Finding: Seems to work much better than the p2292 system.
Monitor arm can be fastened to this panel (with regular nuts and a wrench) separately
from tightening this panel to the track (which can be done with finger-tightenable knobs).

