=part-set p2308
short-description: 1/2 ID to 1/4 OD irrigation tubing port/adapter
members: p2240, p2239, p2242, p2306, p2307

| Part ID | Role                                                                                              |
|---------+---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|
| p2240   | 3/4"-10 1/4" tube port plug                                                                       |
| p2239   | O-ring squishing 1/4" tube terminating bulkhead / 'solid washer'                                  |
| p2242   | O-ring squishing 1/4" tube washer, for use inside port                                            |
| p2306   | Through-hole (1+1/4"-7 threaded) port with 1/4" tube port on one end, 1/2" tube port on the other |
| p2307   | Nut for tigtening 1/2" tubing onto barb                                                           |

p2306 and p2307 are interchangeable with the [[https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09ZDKP1T1][tubing adapters that I bought online]]
([[http://picture-files.nuke24.net/uri-res/raw/urn:bitprint:P24W2T2COKIS2FWD3MZHX2ECAEAV25H6.LVHJ4FYFKLPDT66H2UHM2V3BD35M2MR3PT43BDA/20251103_164301.jpg][pic]]).

Note that the 7/8" threads are non-standard; they are 10 threads per inch rather than the usual (UNC) 9.

