=part-category p2374
short-description: discbound notebook discs

=part-category p2375
short-description: drywall ports based on 1+1/4-7-UNC nuts

Nuts with 1+1/4-7-UNC threads go behind a 1+1/2" hole in your drywall.

A bolt with a tapered flange screws into that, filling the hole in such
a way that the front of the bolt is flush (or almost flush) with the wall.
Different bolts can be used to provide different ports.


